@start docs/queues.md
# Queues

| exchange | routing key | consumer |
|---|---|---|
| orders | order.placed | invoice.consumer |
| orders | order.dispatched | shipping.consumer |
| orders | order.cancelled | refund.consumer |

Routing keys are part of the contract with the warehouse integration.
They are not renamed with the code that publishes them.

